'''Rogue''' is an unofficial [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]] that is unobtainable for regular players. It can be obtained by typing the [[Commands|command]] "/test4".

Rogue is a spec developed by Norp, also known as Norperz. It has 2 skills, effectively acting as a [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]], both skills one-shotting anything it touches, as well as having no cooldown.

Rogue that does not have a physical form or icon. This is the first secret fruit added to the game. After a while, the second fruit named [[Meme (Admin)]] was added.

