==Trivia==
* Rogue was first revealed to the community in this [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGhlI7BOid8&t=76s| video] by Norp.
* Even though Rogue has no mechanism related to [[Blox Fruits]], some admins still classify this as a Blox Fruit.
* Rogue is based on a spell from ''[https://www.roblox.com/games/3016661674 Rogue Lineage]'', also known as ''Mori''.
* Since Rogue does not have an icon, it uses its ID "Rogue-Rogue" as icon.

